Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Suggested Experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6b48d5ee-8895-e84f-9985-18958b360849"],

Cell["\<\
1. Phase twist vs pure absorption: Switch Component to \"Real\" in Lab S2A \
and vary F2 Phase away from 0 deg to see phase-twist distortions on COSY \
peaks; contrast with \"Magnitude\".\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6d60ea42-b651-4047-b8b2-bf0c18c8ac95"],

Cell["\<\
2. Zero-fill & resolution: Toggle ZeroFill between 1, 2, and 4 in Lab S2A and \
inspect Peak smoothness in the F2 projection.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8b9cd545-d03a-d541-bac4-fcd3999ff883"],

Cell["\<\
3. Coherent rotor-phase locking: Compare CarouselAverage -> 1 (single \
gamma_0) against 4 and 8 in Lab S2B and verify spinning-sideband suppression \
across t1 and t2.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ce04f2b1-f000-9f4f-afc2-55b5f4d3a920"],

Cell["\<\
4. Spinning speed dependence: Vary MAS Rate between 5 kHz, 10 kHz, and 20 kHz \
in Lab S2B to observe dipolar/CSA averaging and sideband separation.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a98f3a7d-e80f-4545-91c2-69b7e1b205f0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Summary", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3a6b838c-d7de-9a45-b3c3-813b26ab573f"],

Cell["\<\
Signal2D combines SpinDynamica's exact spin-physics conventions with secular \
block diagonalization, compiled operator-atom ensembles, and Floquet-Magnus \
COMPUTE2D propagation to make 2D solution, static-powder, and MAS NMR \
simulations orders of magnitude faster than point-by-point ODE loops.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5dc09d4c-0d6c-fd4c-8a57-8bfe3ace90cc"],

